Hanzo Crawl is a fork. It has been rebranded and adapted for the Hanzo stack:
the Python package was renamed crawl4ai -> crawl, hosts point at crawl.hanzo.ai,
CI builds multi-architecture images to ghcr.io/hanzoai/crawl on Hanzo's own
runners, and secrets resolve through Hanzo KMS.

The full upstream history is preserved in this repository's git log, and the
upstream remains available as the `upstream` remote. Original attribution files
(LICENSE, CONTRIBUTORS.md, SECURITY-CREDITS.md, SPONSORS.md) are carried forward
unmodified.
